 "remarks": "Welcome to 154 Cold Spring - Homeowners and Investors take note! Don't miss this spacious, light-filled 1-bedroom, 1-bath home in the heart of Stamford, minutes from shopping, dining and everyday conveniences.    This bright unit features laminate wood floors throughout, a newer white kitchen with granite countertops and brand-new microwave, and an oversized bedroom that opens to a large screened-in balcony. Additional downstairs storage, two parking permits and designated visitor parking add convenience. Residents can park next to the unit in numbered spots.     Enjoy a gorgeous community pool, landscaped grounds and walking paths. Move right in and make it your own, or take advantage of a well-located opportunity to build equity and add to your investment portfolio.",
